<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2575" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἴνυμαι</span></b> , poet. Verb, only in pres.
		and impf. without augm.:— <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>take</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἴνυτο τεύχε᾽ ἀπ᾽ ὤμων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					11.580
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				13.550
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπὸ πασσάλου αἴνυτο τόξον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					21.53
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χεῖρας αἰνύμεναι</span>
			<i>taking hold of</i>, <i><span class="en">
				22.500
			</span></i>: c. gen. partit., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τυρῶν αἰνυμένους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					9.225
				</span></i>
			: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλλά μ᾽ Ὀδυσσῆος πόθος
				αἴνυται</span> a longing <i>seizes</i> me for him, <i><span class="en">
				14.144
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Sc.</u>
				41
			</span></i>; <i>enjoy, feed on</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καρπόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Simon.
					5.17
				</span></i>
			. (Root <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰ-</span>, as in <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔξ-αι-τος</span>.)</div>
